n\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/88058b03230bf549d5a53d1c3003bd86.avif?t=1701898351\" /></div> RACES:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> CRAB WARRIORS are crab-like creatures covered with durable armor. They activated during a long battle, becoming more aggressive. Crab Warriors excel in defense.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> ELEMENTALS are the creations generated by magical energy. A special magical attraction allows their bodies to maintain their shape. Elementals excel at manipulating magic.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> KEEPERS OF TIME are the embodiments of periods of eternity formed by mixing time and space. They are superior to everyone else in the control of time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> PARASITES are the countless clusters of endoparasitic worms. They live in the ducts of their secretion. Parasites excel in antagonism.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> ALCHEMISTS are the creatures who have devoted themselves to the study of the nature of magical matter. They heal wounds by the universal composition, which they concentrate from disintegrated fragments of hypermaterial clouds. Alchemists excel in the ability to regenerate.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> MYCELIUM are the vegetative bodies of highly developed fungi. They feed on electricity, which they need to maintain the higher functions of the mind. They can grow wherever there is a source of electricity. Mycelium excels in possession of lightning.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> DRAGONFLY is the materialized hallucinations caused by the fumes of dangerous bromine compounds, known for their ability to ignite other elements quickly. They cause a dangerous state of &quot;bad trip,&quot; from which there is no way back. Dragonfly excels in possession of fire.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> SOUL ABSORBERS are the primitive creatures that mutated by feeding on the arcane. Astral mystical energy, permeating their bodies, complements their primitive instincts, creating a most dangerous combination. Soul Absorbers excel in possession of the arcane.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> WAR OS is the bio-robots in high-tech suits. They are under the control of a combat operating system while using high technologies to calculate and destroy enemies. War OS surpass everyone else in speed.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> SHADOW SPINNERS are the arachnid insects predators that once have entirely fused with their shadow. Their spider webs are very durable, and their wool practically does not reflect light. Shadow Spinners excel at stealth.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/c59bdfd1dfda3c355fa7a114f1754ba9.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> each <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/5506a795181dce1faf2338be3b981504.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> has more than ten abilities, five buildings and three satellites that open up access to unique weapons in keeping with the effect of a special aura.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409760/extras/3a40fb0bac0eeac2070ffed702343c39.webp?t=1701898351\" /></div> GAME FEATURES: <br>\u2020 3 game modes: ARENA, QUEST, TOWER<br>\u2020 random world generator working with 30 level templates<br>\u2020 77 identified creatures that inhabit the game world<br>\u2020 103 (simple) items and 23 crafted artifacts<br>\u2020 many kinds of structures and map objects (181)",
